    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "You can’t modify the size and contents of this event once you create it.",
      "ko": "이 이벤트를 생성한 후에는 크기와 내용을 수정할 수 없습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "64727032a1f120e2e994302618b797e704e136df62827ebbb116b2b7a0e3d20f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "This doesn’t verify that the content matches the MIDI specification.",
      "ko": "이것은 내용이 MIDI 사양과 일치하는지 검증하지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "26bc79e605cac24185167c88aba34b84859aca1bf72c58fce774b6b3cf04939f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "You can only add [`AVMIDIMetaEvent.EventType.tempo`](avmidimetaevent/eventtype/tempo.md), [`AVMIDIMetaEvent.EventType.smpteOffset`](avmidimetaevent/eventtype/smpteoffset.md), or [`AVMIDIMetaEvent.EventType.timeSignature`](avmidimetaevent/eventtype/timesignature.md) to a sequence’s tempo track.",
      "ko": "시퀀스의 템포 트랙에는 [`AVMIDIMetaEvent.EventType.tempo`](avmidimetaevent/eventtype/tempo.md), [`AVMIDIMetaEvent.EventType.smpteOffset`](avmidimetaevent/eventtype/smpteoffset.md), [`AVMIDIMetaEvent.EventType.timeSignature`](avmidimetaevent/eventtype/timesignature.md)만 추가할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "976c3870b5dc8edcaf7c2686d056afe523661ac463e8832fa69a3ec02ee16286",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
